Z||000000||Uaana||09-09-2001||07:42 PM||||Been looking at a couple of winter beaters.<BR>Both have 100k+ mi and are a little rusty. <BR>Both are relativly the same price.<BR>They are...<BR>85 Celica GT<BR>90 Subaru Justy (FWD)<P>Thoughts? Anyone have expericence with either of these?<P>Thanks,||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mach10||09-09-2001||07:48 PM||||Both will be a ball-buster to fix if they break. The sube is NOT worth it without AWD. The Celica is a solid (if rusty) car, but not so hot on gas. <P>Both will go until they hit something...||||reg||7
